"},{"t":"code","text":"data-cardLook"},{"t":"text","text":" — and the sheet sets the variables that variant changes with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"set(...)"},{"t":"text","text":". The others keep their initial value. The set of looks is therefore"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"closed and enumerable, which is what lets the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/style/variants","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"visual matrix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"capture every one of them."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"inherited-a-parent-sets-descendants-read","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Inherited: a parent sets, descendants read"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"{ inherits: true }"},{"t":"text","text":" is for a variable set once on a wrapper and read below it —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a theme, or a card that tints whatever it contains. The default, "},{"t":"code","text":"false"},{"t":"text","text":", is for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a variable an element both sets and reads on itself."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"forwarded-a-parent-re-exposes-a-child-s-variable","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Forwarded: a parent re-exposes a child's variable"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A parent that wants its own API writes "},{"t":"code","text":"set(child, parent)"},{"t":"text","text":": the panel above"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declares "},{"t":"code","text":"panelVars.ink"},{"t":"text","text":" and forwards it to "},{"t":"code","text":"cardVars.ink"},{"t":"text","text":". A caller overrides"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the panel's variable in its own sheet, and the card follows without the panel"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"knowing how the card is built."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"at-runtime-assign","children":[{"t":"text","text":"At runtime: "},{"t":"code","text":"assign"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A value known only at runtime — a progress, a position, a colour picked by the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"user — is written on the element with "},{"t":"code","text":"assign(variable, value)"},{"t":"text","text":", the only thing"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"style:"},{"t":"text","text":" accepts. The sheet reads it like any other variable. Because the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"variable is registered with its kind, the browser can interpolate it: a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"transition"},{"t":"text","text":" on "},{"t":"code","text":"width"},{"t":"text","text":" driven by a percentage variable animates."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"property-is-emitted-not-written","children":[{"t":"code","text":"@property"},{"t":"text","text":" is emitted, not written"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every variable declared with "},{"t":"code","text":"cssVars"},{"t":"text","text":" is emitted as an "},{"t":"code","text":"@property"},{"t":"text","text":" block by the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"build plugin, with its syntax, its "},{"t":"code","text":"inherits"},{"t":"text","text":" flag and its initial value. You"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"never write one by hand. Two rules follow from the registration:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"an initial value must be computationally independent — "},{"t":"code","text":"unit.px(16)"},{"t":"text","text":", not"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"unit.rem(1)"},{"t":"text","text":" — or the browser drops the whole registration; the architecture"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"suite catches it;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"a prefix belongs to one sheet: "},{"t":"code","text":"cssVars"},{"t":"text","text":" throws when two sheets declare the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"same prefix."}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"per-instance-a-variant-sets-what-it-changes","text":"Per instance: a variant sets what it changes"},{"level":2,"id":"inherited-a-parent-sets-descendants-read","text":"Inherited: a parent sets, descendants read"},{"level":2,"id":"forwarded-a-parent-re-exposes-a-child-s-variable","text":"Forwarded: a parent re-exposes a child's variable"},{"level":2,"id":"at-runtime-assign","text":"At runtime: assign"},{"level":2,"id":"property-is-emitted-not-written","text":"@property is emitted, not written"}]}